<h2>Aside 1.8.1</h2>
<p class="intro">a small fix release for aside cloud.</p>
<h3>aside cloud</h3>
<ul>
  <li>if the cloud had forgotten your mac, notes silently stopped after about a month and only quitting and reopening helped. aside now registers itself again on its own.</li>
